  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 6e4e438a5e4e2104ea05f9da0ef249ae, type: 2}
    text: "Ta s\u1EBD kh\xF4ng d\u1EEBng l\u1EA1i. V\xEC ng\u01B0\u1EDDi th\xE2n
